## 📋 API Endpoints Quick List

### **Admin** (/api/admin/*)
- Users, Guru, Siswa (CRUD with transactions)
- Kelas, Jadwal (multi-guru), Mapel
- Ruang Kelas, Reports

### **Guru** (/api/guru/*)
- Schedule (multi-guru)
