## 🎯 Smart Delete Pattern

```javascript
// Check for attendance records
const [attendance] = await db.execute(
  'SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM absensi_siswa WHERE siswa_id = ?',
  [siswaId]
);

if (attendance[0].count > 0) {
  // Deactivate (preserve history)
  await db.execute('UPDATE siswa SET status = "tidak_aktif" WHERE id_siswa = ?', [siswaId]);
  await db.execute('UPDATE users SET status = "tidak_aktif" WHERE id = ?', [userId]);
} else {
  // Hard delete (no history)
  await db.execute('DELETE FROM siswa WHERE id_siswa = ?', [siswaId]);
  await db.execute('DELETE FROM users WHERE id = ?', [userId]);
}
```

